{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>The siege begins\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs, skeletal legions, and shadow-dwelling dwarves are attacking your realm, aiming to destroy the magical strongholds that protect it. Armed with cursed fireballs and siege magic, they descend upon your lands with relentless fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first battle of <i>Shield of Breaker</i> \u2014 a single-player arcade action demo set in a stylized fantasy realm.<br>Deflect enemy fireballs, survive the onslaught, and turn darkness against itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113980/extras/c84db5b352e94bff2733bad2b20347b2.poster.avif?t=1762336957\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113980/extras/c84db5b352e94bff2733bad2b20347b2.webm?t=1762336957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113980/extras/c84db5b352e94bff2733bad2b20347b2.mp4?t=1762336957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Region</strong>: Defend the <i>Borders of Pastoria</i>, the kingdom\u2019s first line of defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Enemy Faction</strong>: Face skeleton minions, explosive enemies and royal skeleton family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong>: Learn to deflect, redirect, and chain enemy fireballs for massive combos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian Trial</strong>: Play as <i>Tobin The Squire</i>, help him to defend his first siege.</p></